    <p data-i18n="en">"For all AI apps" means some tasks are cognitively shallow. The mass of the understanding should scale with the <em>epistemic complexity of the problem</em> — don't put up a hypothesis board for "format this JSON."</p>
    <p data-i18n="zh">“给所有 AI 应用”意味着有些任务认知很浅。理解态的体量应随<em>问题的认识论复杂度</em>伸缩——别给“格式化这段 JSON”摆一块假设板。</p>
